    {
      "id": "rSYU81jdEgoUPyYwml1yt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2600.6227782586907,
      "y": 2568.5280010315264,
      "width": 549.4555053710938,
      "height": 460,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1601467187,
      "version": 904,
      "versionNonce": 632966483,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1789811854078,
      "created": 1789751483354,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Scale\n10M new jobs\nCreate: ~116 new jobs/sec\n\nExecution: 10k jobs/sec\nPeak at 10x: 100k jobs/sec\n\nStoring jobs\njob metadata (id, name, schedule, concurrency, retry, backoff, status)\nhere status can be active, paused, disabled\n\njob run metadata (run_id, job_id, status, start_time, end_time)\nhere status can be queued, scheduled, running, paused, success, failure\n\nStoring jobs: \n1 row = (16B, 32B, 32B, 32B, 8B, 8B,32B) ~ 160 Bytes\n10M new jobs in a day would be 1.6GB per day\nin 1 year would be 1TB per year\n\nStoring runs:\n1 row (16B,16B,16B,16B,16B) ~ 80 B\n10k jobs/sec, 864M per day execution\n1 day = 70GB, 70 GB per day with yearly upto 80TB",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Scale\n10M new jobs\nCreate: ~116 new jobs/sec\n\nExecution: 10k jobs/sec\nPeak at 10x: 100k jobs/sec\n\nStoring jobs\njob metadata (id, name, schedule, concurrency, retry, backoff, status)\nhere status can be active, paused, disabled\n\njob run metadata (run_id, job_id, status, start_time, end_time)\nhere status can be queued, scheduled, running, paused, success, failure\n\nStoring jobs: \n1 row = (16B, 32B, 32B, 32B, 8B, 8B,32B) ~ 160 Bytes\n10M new jobs in a day would be 1.6GB per day\nin 1 year would be 1TB per year\n\nStoring runs:\n1 row (16B,16B,16B,16B,16B) ~ 80 B\n10k jobs/sec, 864M per day execution\n1 day = 70GB, 70 GB per day with yearly upto 80TB",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
